diff --git a/avatar-override.html b/avatar-override.html
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..6a68549
--- /dev/null
+++ b/avatar-override.html
@@ -0,0 +1,205 @@
+<!doctype html>
+<html data-skin="signal" lang="en" data-theme="dark">
+<head>
+  <meta charset="utf-8" />
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
+  <meta name="description" content="Avatar Override — deactivate the old file, install the new avatar, calibrate, enter the code, lock." />
+  <title>Avatar Override · The Protocol</title>
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="wormhole-dark.css" />
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="wormhole-light.css" />
+<script>(function(){try{var t=localStorage.getItem("the-protocol.theme");if(t==="dark"||t==="light"){document.documentElement.setAttribute("data-theme",t);}}catch(e){}})();</script></head>
+<body>
+<header class="site-header">
+  <div class="site-header__inner">
+    <a class="brand" href="index.html">The Protocol</a>
+    <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation">
+      <a href="overview.html">Overview</a>
+      <a href="index.html">Daily Run</a>
+      <a href="levels.html">Levels</a>
+      <a href="sequences.html" class="is-active">Sequences</a>
+      <a href="custom.html">Custom</a>
+      <a href="bank.html">Bank</a>
+    </nav>
+    <div class="header-actions">
+      <button class="theme-toggle" type="button" data-theme-toggle aria-label="Toggle theme">☼</button>
+      <button class="mobile-menu-toggle" type="button" data-mobile-menu-toggle aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Open menu">Menu</button>
+    </div>
+  </div>
+  <nav class="mobile-nav" data-mobile-nav aria-label="Mobile navigation">
+    <a href="overview.html">Overview</a>
+    <a href="index.html">Daily Run</a>
+    <a href="levels.html">Levels</a>
+    <a href="sequences.html" class="is-active">Sequences</a>
+    <a href="custom.html">Custom</a>
+    <a href="bank.html">Bank</a>
+  </nav>
+</header>
+<main class="shell">
+  <section class="identity">
+    <p class="kicker">Identity Override Sequence</p>
+    <h1>Avatar Override</h1>
+    <p class="lede">Bending reality does not take time. The lag is not the work — it is the wrong avatar. This run goes into the back end, deactivates the old file, installs the new avatar, calibrates the channels, enters the code, and locks. One pass. Breathe as source.</p>
+    <div class="page-actions"><a href="sequences.html">Sequences</a><a href="index.html">Daily Run</a></div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel danger-card">
+    <p class="panel-kicker is-danger">Deactivation</p>
+    <h2>Clear the Old File</h2>
+    <p class="lede">Swipe once. Speak each line out loud or in your mind. Then shake your hands — the system is cleared.</p>
+    <div class="sequence" aria-label="Deactivation switches">
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">01</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Switches</span>
+        <span class="seq-body mini-state-list">
+          <span class="mini-state"><span>Scarcity</span><b class="state-off">OFF</b></span>
+          <span class="mini-state"><span>Delay</span><b class="state-off">OFF</b></span>
+          <span class="mini-state"><span>Waiting</span><b class="state-off">OFF</b></span>
+          <span class="mini-state"><span>Overthinking</span><b class="state-off">OFF</b></span>
+          <span class="mini-state"><span>Proof Seeking</span><b class="state-off">OFF</b></span>
+          <span class="mini-state"><span>Slow Linear Growth</span><b class="state-off">OFF</b></span>
+          <span class="mini-state"><span>Old Self</span><b class="state-off">DELETED</b></span>
+        </span>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="status-strip">
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Action</span><span class="status-value status-complete">Shake hands</span></div>
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Status</span><span class="status-value status-complete">System cleared</span></div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel operation-card">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Activation</p>
+    <h2>Install the New Avatar</h2>
+    <p class="lede">Swipe again. Speak each line ON. Then pull energy into your chest with your hand and issue the install command.</p>
+    <div class="sequence" aria-label="Activation switches">
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">01</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Switches</span>
+        <span class="seq-body mini-state-list">
+          <span class="mini-state"><span>Daily Abundance</span><b class="state-on">ON</b></span>
+          <span class="mini-state"><span>Beauty</span><b class="state-on">ON</b></span>
+          <span class="mini-state"><span>Magnetism</span><b class="state-on">ON</b></span>
+          <span class="mini-state"><span>Ease</span><b class="state-on">ON</b></span>
+          <span class="mini-state"><span>Speed</span><b class="state-on">ON</b></span>
+          <span class="mini-state"><span>Visibility</span><b class="state-on">ON</b></span>
+          <span class="mini-state"><span>Money Overflow</span><b class="state-on">ON</b></span>
+          <span class="mini-state"><span>Receiving</span><b class="state-on">ON</b></span>
+          <span class="mini-state"><span>Source Code</span><b class="state-on">ON</b></span>
+          <span class="mini-state"><span>Field Code</span><b class="state-on">ON</b></span>
+        </span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">02</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Law</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span><code class="command-token command-token--on state-on">Everything always escalates quickly in my favor.</code></span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">03</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Install</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>Pull energy into your chest with your hand.</span><span><code class="command-token command-token--on state-on">INSTALL · INSTALL · INSTALL</code></span></span>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="status-strip">
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Status</span><span class="status-value status-active">New avatar installing</span></div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel operation-card">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Calibration</p>
+    <h2>Two-Finger Calibration</h2>
+    <p class="lede">Two fingers. Touch each point and confirm the channel. Then breathe as source.</p>
+    <div class="sequence" aria-label="Calibration points">
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">01</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Forehead</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span><code class="command-token command-token--on state-on">Identity selected</code></span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">02</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Throat</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span><code class="command-token command-token--on state-on">Expression selected</code></span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">03</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Heart</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span><code class="command-token command-token--on state-on">Reality selected</code></span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">04</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Stomach</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span><code class="command-token command-token--on state-on">Embodiment selected</code></span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">05</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Shoulders</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span><code class="command-token command-token--on state-on">Support selected</code></span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">06</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Hips</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span><code class="command-token command-token--on state-on">Movement selected</code></span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">07</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Knees</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span><code class="command-token command-token--on state-on">Timeline selected</code></span></span>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel operation-card">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Code Entry</p>
+    <h2>Enter 739</h2>
+    <p class="lede">With your fingers, write <code class="command-token">739</code> in the air. Speak the meaning of each digit as you draw it.</p>
+    <div class="sequence" aria-label="Code 739">
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">7</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Expansion</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span><code class="command-token">I allow expansion.</code></span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">3</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Multiply</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span><code class="command-token">I multiply.</code></span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">9</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Normalize</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span><code class="command-token">I normalize impossible outcomes.</code></span></span>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">The Lock</p>
+    <h2>Lock the Avatar</h2>
+    <p class="lede">Final lock. Take your hand and turn an invisible key — like you are locking something in place.</p>
+    <div class="page-actions"><span><code class="command-token command-token--on state-on">LOCK · LOCK · LOCK</code></span></div>
+    <div class="status-strip">
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Status</span><span class="status-value status-complete">Avatar locked</span></div>
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Operator</span><span class="status-value status-active">Running the new file</span></div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="reference-section">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Structure</p>
+    <h2>How the Override Runs</h2>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <p>Avatar Override treats the lag between command and result as a sign that the wrong avatar is running — not as proof the result is far away. The run does not add effort. It deactivates the old file at the source, installs the new one, calibrates the channels that carry it, enters the code that normalizes the impossible, and locks. One pass, in order.</p>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>Movements</h3>
+      <div class="flat-list">
+        <div class="flat-row"><strong>Deactivation</strong><span>Switch off scarcity, delay, waiting, overthinking, proof seeking, slow growth. Delete the old self.</span></div>
+        <div class="flat-row"><strong>Activation</strong><span>Switch on the new defaults and issue the install command into the chest.</span></div>
+        <div class="flat-row"><strong>Calibration</strong><span>Touch each point and confirm the channel it carries.</span></div>
+        <div class="flat-row"><strong>Code Entry</strong><span>Write 739 — allow expansion, multiply, normalize impossible outcomes.</span></div>
+        <div class="flat-row"><strong>The Lock</strong><span>Turn the key. The new avatar is sealed and running.</span></div>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+</main>
+<footer class="footer">The Protocol</footer>
+<script src="wormhole-lab.js"></script>
+</body>
+</html>
